stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OpenQueue : Administrator opens report queue
    OpenQueue --> SelectReport : Filter pending/verified reports
    SelectReport --> ReviewEvidence : Open report details & photo
    ReviewEvidence --> Decision : Verify, reject, or request correction
    Decision --> RejectReport : Reject with reason
    Decision --> AssignTask : Verify report
    RejectReport --> UpdateStatus : Set status = Rejected + reason
    UpdateStatus --> NotifyCitizen : Citizen sees rejected status
    NotifyCitizen --> [*]
    AssignTask --> SelectStaff : Choose collection staff member
    SelectStaff --> SetDueDate : Set target date & instructions
    SetDueDate --> CreateTask : Save collection task (status=Pending)
    CreateTask --> LinkReport : Link task to verified report
    LinkReport --> UpdateReportStatus : Set report status = Assigned
    UpdateReportStatus --> NotifyStaff : Task visible in staff dashboard
    NotifyStaff --> [*]
